    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a natural extension of my analytical mind—highly structured yet deeply rewarding. My high conscientiousness and openness make patterns and logic intuitive for me, though I still find abstract concepts challenging without clear steps. It’s both a tool and a passion, especially in physics, where precision matters.",
